# Build output. Never committed: it is platform-specific, it goes stale the
# moment the source changes, and nobody can tell from a diff whether a
# checked-in binary matches the source beside it.
#
# The repository carried GuessTheNumber/main -- a 16 KB x86-64 ELF -- until
# v0.2.0. It is untracked from here on; the blob stays in history, which is
# not worth rewriting published commits over.
Build/
build/
*.o
main
guessthenumber
